note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Contract section 4 lines 102-104: inside unrolled or inlined bodies only, all-constant operations
note fold with OM-1 arithmetic; an operation that would trap is not folded, so a guarded
note if ne i 0 / div 100 i compiles and behaves as before (no compile error at the i = 0 copy).
note Lines: unsigned div, unsigned rem, signed long div under the guard, and an inlined guard q.
note Twin fold-guard-rolled.om (unroll and inline removed) has the same expected stdout:
note oracle/s3s4/exp/fold-guard.out (python3, oracle/s3s4/oracle.py).
om2
fn q a ulong b ulong to ulong inline
if eq b 0
ret 0
end
ret div a b
end
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4 unroll
if ne i 0
s = add s div 100 i
end
end
pu s
r = ulong 0
for i ulong 4 unroll
if ne i 0
r = add r rem 101 i
end
end
pu r
t = long 0
for i long 4 unroll
if ne i 0
t = add t div 1000000 i
end
end
pu ulong t
pu q 100 0
pu q 100 7
ret 0
end
